2:Tb4e,
<!-- Chat History Area -->
<div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
<!-- User Message -->
<div class="flex justify-end animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-right duration-700">
<div class="glass-card inner-glow chat-bubble-user max-w-[85%] px-6 py-4 shadow-xl animate-float-delayed">
<p class="font-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
                        I'm feeling a bit overwhelmed by the noise of the world today. I need a place to ground myself and find focus.
                    </p>
<span class="font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant/40 mt-2 block text-right">09:41 AM</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Luma Assistant Micro-Narrative -->
<div class="flex justify-start items-start gap-4 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-left duration-700 delay-300">
<!-- Avatar with floating animation -->
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-1 border border-primary/20 animate-float">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-lg" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">arrow_back_ios_new</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-3 max-w-[85%]">
<div class="glass-card inner-glow chat-bubble-luma px-6 py-5 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden animate-float">
<!-- Gentle Luma Glow effect -->
<div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
<p class="font-body-lg text-primary-fixed-dim italic mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                            "The deepest part of the forest is often the quietest, yet it's where the roots grow strongest."
                        </p>
<p class="font-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
                            I hear you. Take a deep breath. Imagine the air as a cool, emerald mist filling your lungs. We are here in this digital sanctuary, where the only rhythm that matters is yours.
                        </p>
<p class="font-body-md text-on-surface mt-4">
                            Shall we begin a sensory grounding exercise, or would you like to explore some of our quiet resources for stewardship?
                        </p>
<span class="font-label-sm text-on-surface-variant/40 mt-3 block">Luma Guide • Just now</span>
</div>
<!-- Suggested Actions (Chips) -->
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom duration-1000 delay-500">
<button class="bg-primary/10 border border-primary/20 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-sm text-primary hover:bg-primary/20 transition-colors active:scale-95">
                            Sensory Grounding
                        </button>
<button class="bg-secondary-container/30 border border-outline-variant/30 px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-label-sm text-secondary hover:bg-secondary-container/50 transition-colors active:scale-95">
                            Stewardship Guide
                        </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="chat-end"></div>
</div>
